       src/internal/utf8.c. linenoise.c uses no other module of the fork,
       and cmdr needs no tree-sitter or syntax themes.
Patch: src/linenoise.c switches terminal modes with TCSADRAIN, not
       TCSAFLUSH. TCSAFLUSH discarded input not yet read, so a second line
       typed or pasted before the first returned was lost.
       linenoise_history_save returns -1 when a write or fclose fails;
       it returned 0, so cmdr could not tell a truncated save from a good one.
